  "theme": "Your fast-speech error patterns (targeted)",
  "pillar": "applied",
  "star": true,
  "rule_en": "Your greatest hits: didn't + base (never didn't went), he/she doesn't, for two years / since 2023, no perfect with finished time, said vs told, If + past perfect (never 'would have' twice), was able to (never 'could able to'), and stative verbs stay simple (I know, not I'm knowing).",
  "rule_bn": "তোমার কমন ভুল: didn't + base verb; he/she + doesn't; for + সময়কাল, since + শুরুর বিন্দু; শেষ হওয়া সময়ের সাথে perfect নয়; said me নয় — told me; 'could able to' বলে কিছু নেই; know/like/need always simple।",
